	(lib_symbols)
	(text "SCSI front end (blocks/2-scsi-frontend.md, parts list §2)\nIDC50 + HD50 (DNP) connectors, 18 × H5VUD5BB ESD at the connector, RESERVED 0 Ω links,\nterminator: 3 × SN74LVTH245A + 36 × 220 Ω (2 per line) + DIP switch, LA header 2×16.\nBus lines carry active-low (overbar) labels; channel sheets hold the per-line driver and receiver.\nESD and terminators stay here so they can be placed at the connector."
